{"title": "正则按配置顺序，不是最长匹配", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location ~ /a     { return 200 \"A\"; }  # 写在前面"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "location ~ /a/b/c { return 200 \"ABC\"; } # 写在后面"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s http://127.0.0.1/a/b/c"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HIT regex-A(short,first)"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "/a/b/c 同时匹配两个正则，命中靠前的 ~ /a"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "→ 正则块的书写顺序就是优先级"}
]}
